OL,3,APM warned Rosebank oil field could
OL,4,Abreach West Bank sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental campaigners and Green
OL,7,FParty leader Zack Polanski have both
OL,8,Fseparately written to Andy Burnham and
OL,9,Fthe foreign secretary to raise concerns
OL,10,Fabout Rosebank's links to an Israeli
OL,11,Fcompany, Delek Group.
OL,13,FLast year Delek Group was included in a
OL,14,FUN database of firms which allegedly
OL,15,Fprovide services or utilities to
OL,16,Fsupport settlements in occupied
OL,17,FPalestinian territories.
